Hours — location page, same week (conflicts): Nov 15 Closed; Mon Nov 16 5:30am–2:00pm; Tue Nov 17 5:30am–2:00pm; Wed Nov 18 8:30am–5:00pm; Thu Nov
19 Closed; Fri Nov 20 8:30am–5:00pm; Sat Nov 21 9:00am–5:00pm. The banner on that page says “Opens Monday at 7:30am”.
Locations page description: “Craving something classic, but with your own twist? Mosaic Cafe, our one-stop shop, has it all: our full Subway® menu, including all your
favorite sandwiches and toppings, plus Starbucks® drinks and all your go-to snacks!” However, no Starbucks drink items were shown in the menu as collected; the
only beverage-like item is “Oreo”.
Note on categories: the site’s category headings on this menu are beverage headings — Hot Chocolate, Lemonade & More; Frappuccino Blended Beverages; Chocolate
Beverages; Espresso Beverages; Cold Coffees — but the items under them are Subway sandwiches, proteins, breads, cheeses, sauces and toppings. The category
assignment is therefore unreliable, so the items below are listed as one deduplicated set, without the site’s category headings. Portion variants are kept where the site
lists them (for example, The Wicked Small 430 cal / Medium 700 cal).')
ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE restaurant_id=VALUES(restaurant_id);
ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE id=VALUES(id);
