('5901beba551547ea84eac43aafdfdbbb9abbac4932c6cae9da1dcc8b598932b6', NULL, NULL, 'Dataset caveats, source PDF page 26: 
Prices. No prices were shown anywhere on the site for any item at any location. The Fuse price of $18 for an AYCE buffet was supplied by the user, not the site. Every
other price in this document is “not shown”.
Hours conflict. For the week of Nov 15–21, 2026, the Hours of Operation page and each location’s own page give different hours for all four locations. Both sets are
quoted in the location sections above; the Hours page set is used as primary. Hours for Nov 1–13 are only available as the meal-period times shown on each day’s menu
page (breakfast 7:00–9:30am, brunch 11:00am–2:00pm, lunch 11:00am–2:00pm, dinner 4:30–7:30pm) — the Hours page’s week selector had its “previous week”
control disabled, so no Nov 1–13 hours table could be pulled. The Fall 2026 Hours poster image on the Hours page is an image only; its text was not extracted (the
structured Hours table is the source used).
Fuse past-date data was unstable during collection. Nov 9 dinner first read showed a full distinct-station menu; on re-check the same URL showed only the 9-item flat
set. Re-checking Nov 2 lunch (clean at first) also showed a different flat 11-item set. Not every clean meal was re-checked, so further flat-set items for already-clean
meals may exist that were not captured. Nov 9 dinner’s first-read full menu was not fully transcribed before the page changed, so its items are included only where they
also appear on other clean days.
Florida Poly Dining Menu Database (cid:127) dineoncampus.com/flpoly (cid:127) Sources collected Nov 15, 2026 Page 26', 1, 26),
